The logical printer routes in the label transcription are current from
September. Please don't use the August service mapping just because it
has a cleaner photocopy.

ESC-N is the north coupon used for the masked component. Use the last
acknowledged attempt for its exact job. The later REQUESTED entry was a
button press that never returned an acknowledgement. WATCH-SPARE is an
unrelated spare; its payload happens to be the same length.

The buffer reconstruction is a retained-fragment export. It includes
ordinary labels and older requests. We do not have an independent payload
checksum for every line recovered from this printer. The ACK field came
from the dispatch log, so it should not be read as a media-integrity flag.

